title Order flow
dir right|down
group backend Backend services
group edge
user User (person)
web Web shop @globe [in edge]
api API gateway @nginx in backend
orders Orders service (note) in backend
paid (circle)
start[Order placed]
check{Stock available?}
db Database (cylinder) [in backend] [!accent]
Here is the full flow of the order system:
part r1 resistor
user -> web [clicks]
web -> api request
api -> Orders place
orders -> dbb save
api --> cache warm
label users Customers
step Browse: The user opens the shop | user web user -> web
step Save: Orders are written | orders db orders->db
